# Redirects for the static site, read by Cloudflare Workers Assets from the root of the
# uploaded directory (static/ is copied to the build root verbatim). Like _headers, this
# is answered by the platform without invoking the Worker.
#
# A person or an institution is shared as its record page. The preview page that used to
# stand at /share/entity/<id> is gone; links already handed out answer 301 to the record.
# Relationship shares keep their preview page and are not listed here.
/share/entity/* /e/:splat 301
